Homepage: https://www.phpdoc.org
Description: Documentation Generator for PHP
 phpDocumentor enables you to generate documentation from your PHP source
 code. With this you can provide your consumers with more information
 regarding the functionality embedded within your source and not just what
 is usable to them from your user interface.
 .
 Documentation generated by phpDocumentor is supplemental, or reference,
 documentation useful for API consumers, framework developers, and maintainers
 of complex long-running projects.
